<Layout title="Privacy & Image Credits" description="How this demonstration website handles project inquiry information, local preferences, and photography credits."><section class="section legal-page"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY & CREDITS</p><h1>A little<br/><em>transparency.</em></h1><p class="large-copy">This notice describes the behavior of this demonstration website.</p><h2>Project inquiry information</h2><p>The inquiry form prepares an email draft in your browser. It does not send form data to a server, save it in local storage, or claim that an estimate request has been received. When you choose to send an email, your email provider processes the message under its own policies.</p><h2>Local preferences</h2><p>This site uses session storage to remember whether the short brand entrance has already played in the current tab. No advertising or analytics trackers have been added. Your hosting provider may process standard request logs.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Fonts, scripts, and photographs are served with the website. Phone and email links open your device’s calling or email applications. No third-party map, review widget, or form service is embedded.</p><h2>Photography & content</h2><p>Company project photographs correspond to published Ocean General Contractors project updates. Project descriptions are limited to information present in those updates. Design inspiration photographs are from Unsplash and are labeled separately from company work.</p><p>Inspiration images are used under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash License</a>. The source image identifiers and research references are recorded in the project’s asset documentation. All imagery is locally hosted and optimized.</p><h2>Customer feedback</h2><p>Review excerpts are attributed to the names published on the company website. They have not been independently authenticated. No aggregate rating is claimed.</p><h2>Before production</h2><p>If direct form submission, analytics, or marketing messaging is introduced, this notice must be updated to describe the actual providers, processing, retention, and choices available.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions, email <a href="mailto:bluecollarcorgis@gmail.com">bluecollarcorgis@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+14086798566">(408) 679-8566</a>.</p><p class="fine-print">Last updated October 13, 2026.</p></section></Layout>
